WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.645
CMMC 2.0 verifies cybersecurity implementation for protected information across the

00:00:05.645 --> 00:00:07.120
Defense Industrial Base.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.625
FCI and CUI drive information-protection, system-scope, and contract decisions.

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:15.740
The three CMMC levels connect increasing requirements and assessment assurance to contract

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.269
risk, with Level 2 aligned to NIST SP 800-171.

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:23.330
Strong programs integrate governance, engineering, operations, supplier management,

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.720
evidence, assessment, monitoring, and continuous improvement.
